    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Formula for Market Price: Market Price (MP) = Factor Cost (FC) + Indirect Taxes - Subsidies.",
        "Dadabhai Naoroji made the first non-official estimate of National Income in India in 1867-68, while Dr. V.K.R.V. Rao provided the first scientific estimate in 1931-32.",
        "Depreciation is the key distinction between Gross and Net concepts: Net Aggregate = Gross Aggregate - Depreciation."
